<Layout
  title="Guias de Engenharia | Calculadoras de Bateria"
  description="Guias práticos de engenharia sobre fundamentos de bateria, dimensionamento, solar, RV e marítimo, e análise financeira de BESS."
  canonical="https://batterycalculators.com/pt/learn/"
  lang="pt"
>
  <div class="mb-12 border-b border-hairline pb-8">
    <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-xs block mb-4">CENTRO DE APRENDIZAGEM</span>
    <h1 class="text-display-md text-primary mb-6">Guias de Engenharia</h1>
    <p class="text-body-md text-body max-w-2xl font-light">
      Explicações práticas dos principais conceitos de engenharia elétrica. Cada guia aponta para a calculadora relevante para aplicar as fórmulas diretamente.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-16">
    {articles.map((article) => (
      <a href={`/pt/learn/${article.slug}/`} class="block group">
        <CalculatorCard class="h-full flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-label-uppercase text-m-blue-light text-[10px] block mb-2">{article.category}</span>
            <h2 class="text-title-lg text-primary mb-3 group-hover:text-m-blue-light transition-colors">{article.title}</h2>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-muted mb-4">{article.description}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {article.tools.map((tool) => (
              <span class="text-[10px] text-primary border border-hairline px-2 py-0.5 uppercase tracking-wider">{tool}</span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </CalculatorCard>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>
</Layout>
